%% Dynamic view - optional remote inference (RETFound / PRISM-DR)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Clinician
  participant UI as Review page
  participant API as Review API (_factory.infer)
  participant DER as imaging/derivatives.py
  participant RP as providers/remote.py
  participant M as Model API (GPU host)
  C->>UI: Analyze
  UI->>API: POST /v1/infer/global and /v1/infer/lesion-roi
  API->>API: is_inference_eligible(admission), else HTTP 409
  API->>DER: analysis_image(source)
  DER-->>API: analysis bytes + analysis SHA-256 + coordinate mapping
  API->>RP: infer(request, analysis image)
  RP->>M: POST /v1/predict/dr or /v1/predict/lesions (Bearer if set, 30 s timeout)
  M->>M: verified assets - RETFound grade / PRISM-DR boxes
  M-->>RP: GlobalResult / LesionResult + provenance
  RP-->>API: validated result
  API->>API: map lesion boxes back to original-image pixels
  API->>API: save_result: INFERENCE event with source SHA, analysis SHA, transform
  API-->>UI: model evidence (uncalibrated score, optional overlays)
